# Records demo/plan.gif: `claudash plan --share`, with made-up data (see demo/README.md).
Output demo/plan.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 900
Set Height 560
Set Padding 20
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 55ms

Hide
Type "sh demo/fixtures.sh && export HOME=/tmp/demo CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR=/tmp/demo/.claude XDG_CACHE_HOME=/tmp/demo/.cache PATH=/tmp/demo/bin:$PWD/target/x86_64-unknown-linux-musl/release:$PATH && clear"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Show
Sleep 500ms
Type "claudash plan --share"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 5s
